Root Cause Analysis (RCA) - P-101 Bearing Failure
Date of Incident: 2026-06-12
Asset: P-101

Summary:
The centrifugal pump P-101 experienced severe bearing degradation requiring replacement via WO-9921.

Root Cause:
The unit was operated at 3.8 mm/s vibration. While this was below the old superseded v1 limit of 4.5 mm/s, it exceeded the current approved v2 limit of 3.0 mm/s. The failure to adhere to the current SOP v2 resulted in accelerated wear.
